can strengthen them. Verbal 'take place' and web-site uses are distinguished.
The program joins English token fragments, remembers a preceding modifier,
and resets at document boundaries. Some following 'of' constructions have
separate values. Multi-letter all-caps fragments are ignored; most other text
returns zero. The remaining lexical responses are deliberately not modeled.
"""
